# Egress allowlist — one fnmatch glob per line, matched against the parsed
# HOST only (verified on tinyproxy 1.11.3), never the path or userinfo. So
# `http://discord.com@evil.com/x` is denied (real host evil.com), and a path
# like `evil.com/discord.com` is denied too.
#
# Anchoring gotchas (fnmatch, no FNM_PATHNAME → `*` also matches dots):
#   - `*.discord.com` does NOT match the apex `discord.com`; list both shapes.
#   - `gateway.discord.gg` is a different registered domain from discord.com —
#     list it explicitly.
#   - A leading `*` with no dot is DANGEROUS: `*discord.com` would also match
#     `evildiscord.com`. Prefer exact apexes and `*.<domain>` subdomain globs.
#
# Placeholders; replace with what THIS project's app actually calls.
api.anthropic.com
discord.com
*.discord.com
gateway.discord.gg
